The mesh is low-poly and original. It is not a scan. It does not use a
photograph or photogrammetry as a texture. Colour is vertex colour only.
The deck graphic — an SMC coin with an S, tropical leaves and an orange
sun — is an original simplification of the approved concept
skate_concepto_v1. Please attribute: LIFE INC, CC BY-SA 4.0.
